 "transcript": [
  "[action] eldest son leaves land with wife",
  "[action] Wang Lung watches his sons as they leave.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and I am a man now and I have a wife and we live in a fine house and I am in the town with the rich men.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son laughs at his brother's complaints.",
  "[action] The eldest son watches his brother with a sly smile.",
  "[action] Wang Lung laughs at his sons' complaints.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what now? Am I never to be free in my house?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I am not so foolish to be a servant to my father any longer.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now I have no son, and he is more like his mother in his pride.\"",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung calls his second son.",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"Well, and what do you say, and have you no wish to do as your elder brother?\"",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I have a wife, and I have a son, and I will not be a slave in this house any longer.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"I have no sons,\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"I have two sons and they are both men, and they will be in the western room from now on.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung leads his sons away.",
